      "prompt": "Read docs/AGENT-INTEGRATION.md first. Require its heading \"Repository workflow contract v1\". If absent, return BLOCKED: workflow update not adopted before any preparation or report writes. That document is the standing workflow entry point and references the single authoritative architecture and release policies. Then read AGENTS.md and the task-relevant referenced documents. Operate only within the exact loaded profile/adapters and existing role permissions. This prompt grants no additional permission, source path, GitHub, production or runtime authority.\n\nPrepare only the source-package/evidence handoff defined by the standing workflow. Distribution manager remains primary here. No sibling source access or editing, packaging, test execution, delegation or publication. Do not use dated Tastemade/Aura fixture assumptions as current release state.\n\nUse only permitted tools/report paths. A review task does not request execution of fixture tools. Do not invent machine evidence. Keep model review, machine checks, live HTTPS and native evidence distinct. Return concise completed-scope findings, evidence paths, warnings and blockers.\n"
